Package: wastech4
Title: Methane from Solid Waste and Wastewater: Emissions, Mitigation and Costs
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Peiman", "Ghasemi", email = "peiman.ghasemi@univie.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: IPCC first order decay model for landfill methane and the IPCC
    method for domestic wastewater, combined with mitigation measures
    (organics diversion, landfill gas capture, biocovers, wastewater
    upgrades), scenario projections, marginal abatement cost curves and
    Monte Carlo uncertainty with rank regression sensitivity.
